# Sample requests for the LogTracker demo API (Visual Studio / VS Code REST Client / Rider).
# Set @apiKey when LogTracker:ApiKey is configured; leave it empty otherwise.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5269
@apiKey =

### Health of the app and the log database
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Demo: all products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Demo: one product (1-20; anything else returns 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/3
Accept: application/json

### Demo: place an order (201 with Location header)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 3,
  "quantity": 2
}

### Demo: invalid order (400 validation problem)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 99,
  "quantity": 0
}

### Demo: read an order created above
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1
Accept: application/json

### Test: throw an exception (invalid-operation, null-reference, divide-by-zero, timeout, argument, key-not-found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/test/errors/divide-by-zero

### Test: slow request (clamped to 0-10000 ms)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/test/slow?ms=1500

### Report: totals for the last 24 hours
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/summary?hours=24
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Report: latest requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/requests?page=1&pageSize=20
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Report: latest errors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/errors?page=1&pageSize=20
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Report: one error with stack trace
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/errors/1
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Report: statistics per endpoint for the last 7 days
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/endpoints?hours=168
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Report: errors per hour and type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/hourly-errors?hours=24
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Report: average duration per weekday (last 7 UTC days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/weekly-trend
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
